     [  370.443151]  __schedule+0x18bf/0x4680
     [  370.444293]  tipc_named_dist_cluster_scope+0x1a0/0x220     ←
wait_var_event 睡眠点
     [  370.446076]  tipc_node_dist_bulk+0x6d/0x1b0
     [  370.446218]  process_one_work+0x845/0x1a60

```


